; Actual326: the private read-only /system/bin/odsign bind retains nosuid.
; Linux additionally checks process2:nosuid_transition after NNP admission.
; Admit only original init -> odsign label transition; keep NNP1 and nosuid,
; original domain_auto_trans/entrypoint, UID/groups/capabilities and all file
; permissions. No setuid/file-capability enablement or execute_no_trans grant.
(allow init odsign (process2 (nosuid_transition)))
